                                                "sense_id": "2216ff1a-13be-3b4d-ac88-d4c741f14f4f",
                                                "text": "Mr. Osborn told the Railway Students, \"that the running of the railways is a business. All levels of management and staff must become more cost-conscious and the pursuit of profitability must loom larger in decision-making.\""
